{"dct_title_s":"Master Address Blocks, Cambridge, Massachusetts, 2014","dct_description_sm":["Abstract: MasterAddressBlocks were created for the field work phase of the Master Address Project. The blocks were derived from U.S. Census blocks, and were modified to create a set of maps to be used for field validation and verification of Cambridge addresses. The numbering does not hold any pattern.","Purpose: This polygon layer is used to break down the City into blocks used for giving each address a unique ID. Each address which is associated with a building is broken down by block and unique ID within that block."],"dct_creator_sm":["Cambridge (Mass.). Geographic Information Systems"],"dct_publisher_sm":["Cambridge (Mass.). Geographic Information Systems"],"schema_provider_s":"Harvard","gbl_resourceClass_sm":["Datasets"],"gbl_resourceType_sm":["Polygon data"],"dct_subject_sm":["Street addresses","House numbers","Postal addresses"],"dcat_theme_sm":["Boundaries","Location"],"dct_temporal_sm":["2014"],"dct_issued_s":"2014","gbl_indexYear_im":[2014],"dct_spatial_sm":["Massachusetts","Cambridge"],"locn_geometry":"ENVELOPE(-71.160575,-71.06381,42.403841,42.352775)","dcat_bbox":"ENVELOPE(-71.160575,-71.06381,42.403841,42.352775)","dct_rights_sm":["Use constraints: This layer is available for staff and public use without limitations","Access constraints: Unrestricted Access Online","Data credit: City of Cambridge"],"dct_accessRights_s":"Public","dct_format_s":"Shapefile","dct_references_s":"{\"http://www.opengis.net/cat/csw/csdgm\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/harvard-library/harvard-geodata/main/fgdc/CAMBRIDGE14MASTERADDRESSBLOCKS.xml\",\"http://schema.org/downloadUrl\":\"https://mps.lib.harvard.edu/assets/file/hgl:CAMBRIDGE14MASTERADDRESSBLOCKS\",\"https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles\":\"https://hgl.harvard.edu/data/public/CAMBRIDGE14MASTERADDRESSBLOCKS.pmtiles\"}","id":"harvard-cambridge14masteraddressblocks","gbl_mdModified_dt":"2014-06-13T00:00:00Z","gbl_mdVersio